Z||000010||ChadMan||01-25-2001||08:38 AM||||To answer your tranny question, Bluebottle, the 5-sp wasn't available with the V6 until late in the 1986 model year - so all manual 85 V6's and most manual 86 V6's were 4-sp.<BR>||||reg||1
